{"ref":"BDB, שָׂטַם","hw":"שָׂטַם","html":"† <big><big>[<span dir=\"rtl\">שָׂטַם</span>]</big></big>  <strong>vb. bear a grudge, cherish animosity, against (</strong>NH <span dir=\"rtl\">שָׂטַם</span> Niph., 𝔗 <a data-ref=\"Genesis 27:41\" href=\"/Genesis.27.41\">Gn 27:41</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">שְׂטַם</span>; perhaps akin to <span dir=\"rtl\">שׂטן</span> q.v.<strong>)</strong>;—<br><strong>Qal</strong>  Impf. 3 ms. <span dir=\"rtl\">וַיִּשְׂטֹם</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 27:41\" href=\"/Genesis.27.41\">Gn 27:41</a>, 3 mpl. sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">יִשְׂטְמוּנִי</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 55:4\" href=\"/Psalms.55.4\">ψ 55:4</a>, etc.;—<em>cherish animosity against</em>, acc. pers. <a data-ref=\"Genesis 27:41\" href=\"/Genesis.27.41\">Gn 27:41</a> (J), <a data-ref=\"Genesis 49:23\" href=\"/Genesis.49.23\">49:23</a> (poem in J), <a data-ref=\"Genesis 50:15\" href=\"/Genesis.50.15\">50:15</a> (E), + <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּאַף</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 55:4\" href=\"/Psalms.55.4\">ψ 55:4</a>; of <span dir=\"rtl\">י׳</span>’s persistent assaults on Job, <a data-ref=\"Job 16:9\" href=\"/Job.16.9\">Jb 16:9</a>; <a data-ref=\"Job 30:21\" href=\"/Job.30.21\">30:21</a>.","next":"BDB, מַשְׂטֵמָה²","prev":"BDB, שָׂטה"}